```rust
pub const ROLE_KINDS: &[NodeKindId] = &[COMPONENT, HOOK, SERVICE, DIRECTIVE, PIPE, GUARD, COMPOSABLE];
const BASE_PRIORITY: &[NodeKindId] = &[CLASS, STRUCT, FUNCTION, INTERFACE, ENUM, METHOD];
/// Roles a node plays: its own kind when that is a role kind, plus every entry of its ROLE cell.
/// Sorted by kind id, deduped. The ONE reader every consumer uses (engine liveness, pyo3, neuropil).
pub fn roles_in(kind: Option<NodeKindId>, cells: &[Cell]) -> Vec<NodeKindId>;
pub(crate) fn role_cell(roles: &[NodeKindId]) -> Cell; // Json {"roles":["COMPONENT","SERVICE"]}, names from node_kind::ALL, sorted by id
pub(crate) struct RoleFoldStats { folded: [usize; 7], standalone: usize }
pub(crate) fn fold_role_overlays(g: &mut RepoGraph, calls: &mut [CallSite], refs: &mut [UnresolvedRef]) -> RoleFoldStats;
```
The ROLE payload is parsed by hand (find `"roles":[`, split quoted names, map through node_kind::ALL) - the graph crate stays off serde_json, as http.rs:extract_method_field already does. Unknown names are skipped, never a panic.
fold_role_overlays, in Vec order only (HashMaps are lookup-only, CODE_RULES section 3): (1) index `qname -> Vec<(node index, kind)>` from g.nodes + g.nav. (2) For each node whose kind is in ROLE_KINDS, the base is the first same-qname node whose kind is in BASE_PRIORITY (priority order, then node order); none -> the overlay stays as a standalone role node (e.g. a React arrow-const component the TS parser does not declare), counted `standalone`. (3) base: append/merge ONE ROLE cell (roles union); append overlay cells not already present on the base (compare kind + payload). (4) Edges: rewrite from/to overlay -> base; then drop `base -CONTAINS-> x` when `base -DEFINES-> x` exists (services.rs' duplicates) and drop exact duplicates / self-loops created by the rewrite (only among rewritten edges, so untouched edges keep their bytes and order). (5) calls[].from and refs[].from / from_module: overlay -> base. (6) nav: remove the overlay's name/qname/kind/parent_of entries, remove it from its parent's children_of list, move its children_of to the base (dedupe, order kept). (7) g.nodes.retain(not overlay). Because this runs before build_symbol_table, module_symbols can no longer be shadowed by an edgeless marker (audit #13 closed at the root) and INJECTS / CALLS resolve to the declaration. Marker once per builder call with any role node.
graph/src/merged.rs (~40 LOC): `fn is_declaration(&self, id) -> bool` = the node's kind (first graph whose nav has it) is NOT one of MODULE, PACKAGE, PROJECT, REGION, DOC_SPACE; pick_primary uses `max_by_key(|&id| (self.is_declaration(id), self.degree(id), Reverse(id.0)))`. resolve_name, node_id_by_qname and resolve_span inherit it. Tests: pick_primary_prefers_a_declaration_over_its_file_module (MODULE with higher degree vs same-qname CLASS -> CLASS), existing walk.rs:761 'degree-0 PROJECT must lose' still holds.
